  <data name="Src_MonitorDevicePath_Desc" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Device path that identifies the monitor by hardware rather than by position. When set it takes precedence over monitor-index, so unplugging an earlier monitor no longer swaps the captured screen. The app resolves it to a handle when the pipeline is built; if the monitor is not connected, the recorder fails to initialize instead of capturing a different screen.</value>
